<title>BERMUDA: Norex accepts Sonat offer for Transocean shrs.</title>
<headline>Norex accepts Sonat offer for Transocean shrs.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Bermuda 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norex Industries Inc said it would accept an offer by Sonat Offshore Drilling Inc to buy all Norex's shares in Norway's Transocean A/S.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement late on Tuesday Norex would subscribe to newly issued shares of Sonat in accordance with the offer.</p>
<p>Norex owns about 2.7 million shares of Transocean.</p>
<p>A Norex affiliate which owns 177,500 shares of Transocean will also accept the purchase offer and subscribe to the newly issued Sonat shares.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
</text>
